        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: College of Southern Nevada, University of Nevada, Las Vegas\n- Places: Clark County, Nevada, Las Vegas\n- People: Craig Heyer\n- Topics: county seats, college baseball, academic degrees\n\nFacts:\n- Clark County, Nevada, has had Las Vegas as its county seat since the county was established.\n- The College of Southern Nevada is primarily a two-year college in Clark County, Nevada.\n- The College of Southern Nevada offers four four-year degrees in Dental Hygiene, Medical Lab Scientist, Respiratory Sciences, and Fire & Emergency Services Administration.\n- Before becoming a professional, Craig Heyer played college baseball at the College of Southern Nevada and the University of Nevada, Las Vegas.",
